            "That is why we should talk about heaven — we become so attached to the now that we forget the now is not most important",
            "The hope of our future resurrection is life-giving now: you can throw yourself into life knowing defeats are not the final word",
            "Likewise, the successes of this life are not your final hope either — hold everything with open hands",
            "Is this hope of eternal life enough for you? Are you looking for an interim hope?",
            "Hope in the resurrection frees us to be productive for the Lord: the less this life matters as an end in itself, the more joyful and fruitful we are"
