            "2. Preservation of chastity in ourselves and others (1 Cor 7:2-5)",
            "3. Watchfulness over the eyes and all the senses (Matt 5:28; Job 31:1)",
            "4. Temperance, keeping of chaste company, modesty in apparel (1 Tim 2:9-10)",
            "5. Marriage by those who do not have the gift of continency; conjugal love and cohabitation (1 Cor 7:2)",
            "6. Diligent labor in our callings — industriousness supports marital fidelity",
