            "Our afflictions are light (2 Cor 4:17), short in duration, and limited in extent — God restrained Satan's reach over Job",
            "Affliction is beneficial: it humbles us (1 Pet 5:6; Jer 31:18-19), causes us to pray more (Ps 119:71; Is 26:16), and sanctifies us",
            "Six practical instructions: be sensitive to your cross; cease loving the world; remember that suffering is the road to heaven; think on what God has promised; persevere in reading the Word; always pray for patience"
