            "Action 2 — Be sober: free from intoxicating influences (including digital distraction) that keep the mind from working properly; 1 Peter 5:8 — \"be sober, be vigilant, your adversary the devil walks about as a roaring lion\"",
            "Action 3 — Rest your hope fully on the grace of the return of Christ: our hope is not in relationships, politics, jobs, or theological aptitude, but in the Lord Jesus Christ — we have a \"Dory problem\" and need constant reminding",
            "Action 4 — Be holy in all your conduct (vv. 14-16): as obedient children, we no longer fit the container labeled \"sinner\"; illustrated by a child trying on shorts that no longer fit — we are saints who still sin, but that is not who we are",
