            "For about 900 years, with some exceptions, the church neglected faithful preaching of the Word",
            "In 1518 in Zurich, Zwingli opened Matthew chapter 1 and preached through it verse by verse — what seems commonplace now was revolutionary then; this sparked the Protestant Reformation",
            "The question for our day: why preaching when so many multimedia options exist — video, drama, interpretive dance?"
