          "title": "Conclusion and Preview",
          "subpoints": [
            "The unique doctrine that makes Christianity Christianity is the Trinity — not faith alone, not the Bible, but this doctrine",
            "It is the ultimate boundary: inside it, you are a Christian; outside it (Islam, Mormonism, Jehovah's Witnesses), you are not",
            "Today: Trinity as a whole and the Spirit as a person. Next week: the Spirit is God (not merely a person or created being)"
          ],
