            "Galatians 6:1 — restore the overtaken brother in a spirit of gentleness; the \"spiritual\" are those who walk in the Spirit (Galatians 5:17) and therefore exhibit gentleness",
            "James 1:21 — receive the implanted word with meekness/gentleness; we cannot learn from God's word unless we come submitting to it rather than analyzing or questioning it",
