            "1 Peter 3:4 — the godly wife adorned with the incorruptible beauty of a gentle and quiet spirit; the principal that she prefers others ahead of herself",
            "1 Timothy 6:11 — godly people must pursue gentleness alongside righteousness, godliness, faith, love, and patience"
