            "He used what was available to him; he was likely a farmer pressed into service against the Philistines",
            "The song of Deborah (Judges 5:8) confirms there was not even one shield or spear among 40,000 in Israel",
            "God desires willingness to obey with whatever resources are at hand -- we each have a role in the body of Christ",
            "If nothing else, we can always pray -- and prayer is the armor of God that enables all other service"
