          "subpoints": [
            "Those who should be most convicted by a sermon often are not; those already being faithful are often unduly convicted",
            "John has been hammering faith, obedience, and love as tests of assurance throughout 1 John",
            "He now anticipates that faithful believers with overactive consciences will be unduly condemned",
            "John's goal — and the preacher's goal — is to comfort the afflicted and afflict the comfortable"
          ],
          "scripture": [
            "1 John 3:18-20"
          ]
