            "The church's mission is to disciple the nations — not social justice, adoption services, feeding the poor as ends in themselves",
            "Psalm 33:12: blessed is the nation whose God is the Lord",
            "The process starts with repentance, humiliation, and prayer (1 Chronicles 7)",
            "80 million adult practicing Christians in the US — imagine all turning to God in repentance",
